          "source": "thm-higher-dimensional-spheres-are-simply-connected",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "For every natural number $n\\ge2$, the unit sphere $S^n\\subseteq\\mathbb R^{n+1}$ is simply connected ([[def-simply-connected]]).",
          "uses": [
