          "source": "thm-every-oriented-knot-bounds-a-seifert-surface",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Assume the Axiom of Countable Choice. Every smooth oriented knot $K\\subset S^3$ bounds a connected compact smooth oriented embedded surface $F\\subset S^3$ whose oriented boundary is $K$.",
          "uses": [
